  <item>
    <title>【青山同云雨】明朝心上，后日眉头</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67976d54d74435e4a3116dad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67976d54d74435e4a3116dad</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Feb 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是“我们的浮生诗”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果我们终究会分离，那相遇还有什么意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a>青山一道同云雨，明月何曾是两乡。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a>有些人是慢慢走远的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a>人与人之间的缘分跟天意和人情都有关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a>就像看那些到了冬天必败的花朵，我难舍其姿，却也难留其色。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a>此后我所保留的那部分与你有关的回忆，都会是我对于这段友谊的诠释和对你的追忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>人与人之间的相逢涟漪，不就是一波未平一波又起。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="294">04:54</a>今宵眼底，明朝心上，后日眉头。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6641dc0bbc58fa3bbf25cbe3/lpVpX-Sh7dWNjf3GdgHW3rw604-6.m4a" length="5079677" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:05:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj06VoIxVp4_uBX5bEgmSGrVca2F.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【青山同云雨】唤起一天明月，照我满杯冰雪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67963a71247d51713c6bed7a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67963a71247d51713c6bed7a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽大家好，这里是“我们的浮生诗”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家新春快乐，自由鲜活！</span></p><span></span><p><span>抬起头看见的总是同一个月亮，变中不变的是历久弥新的心脏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a>温暖人心的记忆与你寸步不离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a>我爱的人们会时不时地出现在生活里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a>当下的平静与我而言是难得的珍品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a>只是越来越独立，但并不缺少爱和动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a>如果使出浑身解数也无法改变千愁万绪，这个时候到底该怎样改正更新？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a>借助周围的一切助力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a>如果你要开心，也一定会开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a>唤起一天明月，照我满杯冰雪</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6641dc0bbc58fa3bbf25cbe3/llI0j3hHhxn2ueeukTM1jsi4eIAR.m4a" length="5430080" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:05:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMW9jypKixklUxKNSNskEvXlZoV.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【时时春风扫】尘不到。时时自有春风扫</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6794b474247d51713c36db74</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6794b474247d51713c36db74</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jan 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是“我们的浮生诗”</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果人生是一个个游戏的延续，那你会怎样看待这些不同的游戏经历，又会怎样面对这一个个不完全相似的结局？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a>但游戏终会落幕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a>或许我们已然获得了很多没有料想到的殊荣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a>但因为从未停歇，我获得了同样难得的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a>如果确实不适合了，那见好就收也正合我意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a>去体验吧，真相就在那里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a>尘不到。时时自有春风扫</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6641dc0bbc58fa3bbf25cbe3/lkh8kdfq91w2rTyjMmw-UugL_2BH.m4a" length="5965567" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:06:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiykWOizw3c53TPScoYxG9Dq-Wrv.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【时时春风扫】青春元不老，君知否？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678734c8b21f1c0fb3ffc1e2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678734c8b21f1c0fb3ffc1e2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是“我们的浮生诗”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你说你喜欢春天的盎然气息，说它有花香氤氲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>先别着急，冬天的腊梅开了，可不要错过现在的清香扑鼻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a>一颗赋有生命力的种子就这样种在了心里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a>曾经以为的难以触及，谁知现在竟浸染久矣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">01:29</a>你可能忽然惊觉自己已经经过了目的地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a>我们一直在努力成为更好的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a>都会需要自己的周期去诠释它的生命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">03:53</a>我们背后那条走过的路早就柳暗花明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a>如果你想暂时停下来去回顾曾经，那也没有问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a>青春元不老，君知否？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6641dc0bbc58fa3bbf25cbe3/lvAfPj1rAkvzGh8Sp7t8KwY1lQzd.m4a" length="5594305" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:05:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoRld4cnfDhMdJZ66UeTmDyHFKD4.png"/>
